EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §2.7: gen/cpp holds a stored method's result by value, so a record whose method returns that record holds itself: RecordCycleThroughMethod.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A node.
record Node {
  /// Its value.
  v: Int

  /// Its next node.
  export fn next(self) -> Node? { return none }
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: data }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:4:8
  emit cpp in data mode cannot generate a by-value cycle of records through a stored method result

